		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant-sized construct of exotic rune-covered logs, without a face or fingers.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 22, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +4 (1d8) or splinter blast, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Golem</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine, fire, or magical sources. Immune to damage from acid, cold, electricity, or non-magical sources. Double damage from any fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Splinter Blast</strong>. Golem sprays thorn-like splinters in a near- sized cube centered on golem. DEX 15+ or 1d10 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
